sdvg_DrawTrianglesFillFlatVBO32,int vboId,int byteOffset,int numVerts
Draw previously prepared vertex buffer as filled triangles (32bit float format)

Uses vertex colors.

<pre>
VBO vertex format (12 bytes per vertex):<br>
  +0 u8  r<br>
  +1 u8  g<br>
  +2 u8  b<br>
  +3 u8  a<br>
  +4 f32 x<br>
  +8 f32 y<br>
</pre>

@group Triangle
@groupref Fill
@groupref Color
sdvg_DrawTrianglesFillFlatVBO14_2,int vboId,int byteOffset,int numVerts
Draw previously prepared vertex buffer as filled triangles (14.2 fixed point format)

Uses vertex colors.

<pre>
VBO vertex format (8 bytes per vertex):<br>
  +0 u8    r<br>
  +1 u8    g<br>
  +2 u8    b<br>
  +3 u8    a<br>
  +4 s14.2 x<br>
  +6 s14.2 y<br>
</pre>

@group Triangle
@groupref Fill
@groupref Color
sdvg_DrawTrianglesFillFlatModulateVBO32,int vboId,int byteOffset,int numVerts
Draw previously prepared vertex buffer as filled triangles (32bit float format)

Uses vertex colors, modulated by current fill color.

<pre>
VBO vertex format (12 bytes per vertex):<br>
  +0 u8  r<br>
  +1 u8  g<br>
  +2 u8  b<br>
  +3 u8  a<br>
  +4 f32 x<br>
  +8 f32 y<br>
</pre>

@group Triangle
@groupref Fill
@groupref Color
